BT 1 0 0 1 0 35 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL .562353 Tw (My fee for a 50-minute individual psychotherapy session is $350, and my fee for a 50-minute couples therapy) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.642308 Tw (session is $400, unless we have already discussed alternative fee arrangements based on individual) Tj T* 0 Tw .633125 Tw (circumstances. Fees includes time you arrive late In addition to appointments, I charge this hourly amount for) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
